&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ui:&lt;/strong&gt; show memo in sent details if available (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/LN-Zap/zap-desktop/commit/58800622f10481d05fe34de75d0bd39c9f29f513&quot;&gt;5880062&lt;/a&gt;), closes &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/LN-Zap/zap-desktop/issues/2715&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/LN-Zap/zap-desktop/issues/2715/hovercard&quot;&gt;#2715&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
