&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ui:&lt;/strong&gt; warn of potential liquidity issues when creating an invoice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/LN-Zap/zap-desktop/commit/5fa0e5a8bc28524a4dbc49456baf524cfec33aaf&quot;&gt;5fa0e5a&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
