&lt;h3&gt;Performance Improvements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;don&#39;t fetch onchain fees when paying LN invoice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/LN-Zap/zap-desktop/commit/d346f9fc0f3f185f9b6d0335c2006816ea4f0fcb&quot;&gt;d346f9f&lt;/a&gt;), closes &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/LN-Zap/zap-desktop/issues/3175&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/LN-Zap/zap-desktop/issues/3175/hovercard&quot;&gt;#3175&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;wallet:&lt;/strong&gt; prevent excessive getInfo calls (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/LN-Zap/zap-desktop/commit/0062535c5cea9a745741ee32681b0b20d0b48044&quot;&gt;0062535&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;don&#39;t re-render SeedConfirm on mount (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/LN-Zap/zap-desktop/commit/b9a54e2693fa1a7427a1c5bad5406437ad43eb5f&quot;&gt;b9a54e2&lt;/a&gt;), closes &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/LN-Zap/zap-desktop/issues/2792&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/LN-Zap/zap-desktop/pull/2792/hovercard&quot;&gt;#2792&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;only update known/add fresh txs when polling (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/LN-Zap/zap-desktop/commit/09454b6944371d8ada1164aab946921442edeb39&quot;&gt;09454b6&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;update only sending requests on completion (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/LN-Zap/zap-desktop/commit/d657666c559bfa11f9909094e943b7c7e0dd5280&quot;&gt;d657666&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;activity:&lt;/strong&gt; implement activity list pagination (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/LN-Zap/zap-desktop/commit/f994d0433b6c5f15aa996f9aa6ca4fe6a12a9a0e&quot;&gt;f994d04&lt;/a&gt;), closes &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/LN-Zap/zap-desktop/issues/2404&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/LN-Zap/zap-desktop/issues/2404/hovercard&quot;&gt;#2404&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;simplify activity list renderer (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/LN-Zap/zap-desktop/commit/01584f9cbc769c2f1ebef4c35ee4d4f5d6ba65a7&quot;&gt;01584f9&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
